  "boundary": "This intake contract reconciles already accepted exact-source machine, rendered-browser, and rendered-regression evidence with optional separately validated external human, assistive-technology, or performance records. It may determine that the section-98 evidence matrix is complete, but matrix completion is only readiness for governed qualification review and never automatic lifecycle promotion."
